<h1 class="nm-h1" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:26px;line-height:34px;font-weight:600;color:#1B2B4B;">
  Confirm your email address
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{firstName}} — confirm this address so we can send you match updates and keep your
  account recoverable.
</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="nm-cta" style="margin:24px 0;">
  <tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#1B2B4B" style="border-radius:8px;">
    <a href="{{verificationUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 32px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Confirm email address</a>
  </td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;color:#4B5563;font-size:14px;">
  The link expires in {{expiryHours}} {{plural expiryHours "hour" "hours"}}.
  If the button doesn't work, paste this into your browser:
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;word-break:break-all;font-size:13px;color:#6B7280;">{{verificationUrl}}</p>
